  "title": "Rival Trinamool Factions Get New Names and Symbols for October 6 bypolls",
  "summary": "The Mamata group will rename itself the Mamata All India Trinamool Congress with a 'football player' symbol, while the Ritabrata faction will adopt a new name and symbol for the October 6 bypolls. The Election Commission has barred both factions from using their party names and symbols during the bypolls.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Election Commission has barred both factions of the All India Trinamool Congress (AITC) from using their party name and symbol during the West Bengal bypolls.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Mamata group will be called 'Mamata All India Trinamool Congress' with a 'football player' symbol.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Ritabrata faction will be called 'Democratic Trinamool Congress' with an 'envelop' symbol.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
